<title>USA: CompuServe names European general manager.</title>
<headline>CompuServe names European general manager.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuServe Corp said on Monday it hired a director of Pearson PLC's online business information service as its European general manager.</p>
<p>Jerry Roest, who would focus on European market penetration, ran the FT Profile for British multi-media publisher Pearson, CompuServe said in a statement.</p>
<p>Most recently, he was the managing director of UK operations at Europe Online.</p>
<p>CompuServe said its three European regional managers would report to Roest.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
